// What trainers say (NPCS.md, *Barks*): `when` near (a player coming by, the default), click (clicked
// with nothing to offer) or hit; `moods` to say it only in those. `{call:brother}` names the one
// it calls its brother, and only one who has one says it.
{
  lines: [
    "Practice. Then practice again.",
    "Every master was once a beginner.",
    { text: "Your stance is all wrong.", moods: ["gruff"] },
    { text: "Come back when you've learned what you have.", when: "click" },
    { text: "A poor strike.", when: "hit" },
  ],
}
